{"event_type":"review","id":"1ac761188226b772dbec81d7040714dd05a49a4b1ce7dc65829575953867531d","occurred_at":"2026-11-15T14:26:16Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/b025f8771bfdfaf346cdfc55959d83821f57e8f17506ba3fa766f8fcbef53e0b","sha256":"b025f8771bfdfaf346cdfc55959d83821f57e8f17506ba3fa766f8fcbef53e0b"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/b635044b5bf214a964abc43dc161d4385f6cf2e7905c60a55cfc778152598d2d","sha256":"b635044b5bf214a964abc43dc161d4385f6cf2e7905c60a55cfc778152598d2d"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/cac02e07b46cad5e524c5f63570384e0ae48c637e3d63a434ea2847d929416c4","sha256":"cac02e07b46cad5e524c5f63570384e0ae48c637e3d63a434ea2847d929416c4"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/0e0aab34f7b73291bb28306a67a9295305435f2f7df890418948313c129708cf","sha256":"0e0aab34f7b73291bb28306a67a9295305435f2f7df890418948313c129708cf"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/de03c71150a1dd5381abf4a7033b0e786b46703ba8453e21cd8b6f0f3ac96e02","sha256":"de03c71150a1dd5381abf4a7033b0e786b46703ba8453e21cd8b6f0f3ac96e02"}],"attempt_id":"ac5432efbbf17033b3095c9e7664f16979a49095255e913d3ca86045b3bf0564:0:1","base":"64a0bd89c9307314477e2db3ce512cc0e4127773","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"055cdf43daf6ad2a50eb3142bfdeb95d843658a2","body":"**Use the terminal stdio helper for terminal Git spawns.**\n\n`terminalGit` builds child stdio with `checkoutWriterStdio`. That helper admits the spawn as an ordinary checkout writer. After a parent cancellation, `runTerminal` settles cancelled attempts while `stopping` is true and while the owner's `CheckoutWriterContext` store is ambient. The ordinary admission hook then throws `checkout writer after admissions closed` before `spawn`. The settlement Git commands reject, and the cancelled attempt is not settled. The helper written for this path, `checkoutTerminalWriterStdio`, admits terminal writers while the owner is still active. `terminalGit` already validates terminal authority before it spawns, so it can use that helper.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-import { checkoutWriterStdio, trackCheckoutWriter } from '../../../shared/checkoutWriterContext.js';\n+import { checkoutTerminalWriterStdio, trackCheckoutWriter } from '../../../shared/checkoutWriterContext.js';\n```\n\n```diff\n-        { cwd, env, shell: false, stdio: checkoutWriterStdio(['pipe', 'pipe', 'pipe']) },\n+        { cwd, env, shell: false, stdio: checkoutTerminalWriterStdio(['pipe', 'pipe', 'pipe']) },\n```\n\n</details>","id":"552dfc53f98a706d18256202426634a9f3d73a83592b8ba99f6f871d7d91e76c","intervals":[[395,405]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressEvidence.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Use the terminal stdio helper for terminal Git spawns."}],"head":"4df58c533d6aa412def35e39c3891d70a1bd27db","head_tree":"59a8e4bccb16679adcf515ad27331e6995a154f0","input_scope":[{"blob":"055cdf43daf6ad2a50eb3142bfdeb95d843658a2","intervals":[[1,1015]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressEvidence.ts"},{"blob":"a8a254509ea91c48aaa990804cee3a54edf4ec75","intervals":[[1,1159]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressOwnership.ts"}],"job_id":"ac5432efbbf17033b3095c9e7664f16979a49095255e913d3ca86045b3bf0564:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"055cdf43daf6ad2a50eb3142bfdeb95d843658a2","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressEvidence.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"a8a254509ea91c48aaa990804cee3a54edf4ec75","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/review/internal/addressOwnership